# The diff applied to vendor/rawler-0.7.2/ after rawler-web-time.patch.
# Adds restart interval (DRI/RSTn) support to the plain lossless JPEG
# decoder. Samsung Galaxy phones write Linear DNGs whose LJPEG strip has a
# restart marker every 16 rows; without this every row after the first band
# decodes to garbage. Regenerate the full vendored copy via
# ./scripts/setup-vendor-rawler.sh.
diff -ru rawler-upstream/src/decompressors/ljpeg/decompressors.rs rawler-0.7.2/src/decompressors/ljpeg/decompressors.rs
